# 仓库 blob 一直是 LF，但 core.autocrlf=true 的机器检出为 CRLF，会让 prettier
# （endOfLine 默认 lf）在本地必然报不合规、format:check 形同虚设。显式固定检出为 LF。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件禁止任何行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.dmg binary
*.blockmap binary
